    "storyId": "MOCK-HW-1",
    "verdict": "approved",
    "reviewNotes": "Trivial hello-world story with no acceptance criteria to elaborate. Only openspec was assigned, which is appropriate given the coordinator's explicit justification. OpenSpec correctly performed a no-op: no AC changes, no splits, no fabricated code blocks, and accurately classified the story as a defect referencing an existing function. Speckit was not run, which is acceptable for a story of this triviality — there was nothing meaningful for a review agent to harden. Both-agents value-add question is moot; the single agent added no unnecessary content and caused no harm.",
